<title>USA: National Standard Co Dec 31 Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>National Standard Co Dec 31 Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Mich. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>For three months ended December 31:</p>
<p>						 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Net Sales			   $59,874	$60,531</p>
<p>    Operating Profit		    1,645	  2,227</p>
<p>    Net Income				737	  4,344</p>
<p>    Income per Share			.14	    .81</p>
<p>    Average Shares Outstanding  5,313,080    5,384,606</p>
<p>			     ($000 except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTES - '95 net includes approximately $3.5 million or $0.66/shr gain from the sale of shares of Allmerica Financial Corporation, which National-Standard received as a result of the demutualization of the State Mutual Life Assurance Company of America.</p>
</text>
